":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2021-10-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=As%20the%20cultist%20chanted%2C,soaked%20into%20the%20demon.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Dusk Reborn\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e12","era":null,"summary":"Algli offers her life and thrusts her torch into the Buried Lord's mouth, and Liesa channels the fire and hope through her spear to behead him.","participants":["algli","liesa","the-buried-lord"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"major","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"story_date":"2021-10-01","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":91,"quote":"With both hands, Algli thrust her torch into the roof of the Buried Lord's gaping maw.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=With%20both%20hands%2C%20Algli,Buried%20Lord%27s%20gaping%20maw.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Dusk Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2021-10-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=With%20both%20hands%2C%20Algli,Buried%20Lord%27s%20gaping%20maw.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Dusk Reborn\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e13","era":null,"summary":"Liesa beheads the Buried Lord, but his body does not crumble, and she feels they are still bound.","participants":["liesa","the-buried-lord"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"major","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"story_date":"2021-10-01","storyline":"Inni